WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
Architecture decisions should
point back to their evidence.

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:06.640
Measure review and rework because
generation can shift effort.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:11.520
Challenge generated tests because
passing alone can be weak proof.

00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:15.600
Re-evaluate changing
configurations because assurance

00:00:15.688 --> 00:00:19.680
continues through operation.
Enforce tool authority

00:00:19.738 --> 00:00:23.760
externally because actions can have
consequences beyond the response.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:27.680
Retain the versions,
assertions and decisions that let

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:31.520
another engineer inspect whether
these design choices actually hold.
